# Theme Components Quick Reference

Essential patterns for HAPAS theme development. For full guide, see `docs/EVERSHOP-MODULES-EXTENSIONS-WIDGETS-THEMES.md`.

---

## Theme Structure

```
themes/hapas/
├── src/                     # Development source
│   ├── pages/
│   │   ├── all/             # Global components (every page)
│   │   ├── homepage/        # Homepage-specific
│   │   ├── productView/     # Product page
│   │   └── categoryView/    # Category page
│   ├── components/          # Reusable UI (for overriding core)
│   ├── styles/              # Global stylesheets
│   └── assets/              # Images, fonts
├── dist/                    # Compiled (don't edit)
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
```

---

## Component Placement Rules

### ✅ Add New Global Component
→ Use `src/pages/all/`

```tsx
// themes/hapas/src/pages/all/CustomHeader.tsx
export default function CustomHeader() {
  return <header>...</header>;
}

export const layout = {
  areaId: 'header',
  sortOrder: 10
};
```

### ✅ Add Page-Specific Component
→ Use `src/pages/{pageName}/`

```tsx
// themes/hapas/src/pages/homepage/HeroBanner.tsx
export default function HeroBanner() {
  return <div className="hero">...</div>;
}

export const layout = {
  areaId: 'content',
  sortOrder: 1
};
```

### ✅ Override Core Component
→ Use `src/components/`

```tsx
// themes/hapas/src/components/ProductCard.tsx
// Overrides core ProductCard component
export default function ProductCard({ product }: Props) {
  return <div className="custom-product-card">...</div>;
}
```

**Key Difference:**
- `pages/` → Components with `layout` export (area registration)
- `components/` → Reusable UI primitives (overrides)

