## Styling Patterns

### ⚠️ SCSS @import DOESN'T WORK

```scss
// ❌ THIS FAILS
@import '../../styles/variables';

.component {
  color: $primary-color; // Error: Undefined variable
}
```

**Why:** EverShop uses `copyfiles` (not sass preprocessor), so @import isn't resolved.

### ✅ Pattern 1: CSS Variables (RECOMMENDED)

**Step 1:** Define variables globally

```css
/* themes/hapas/src/styles/theme.css */
:root {
  --color-primary: #000000;
  --color-secondary: #666666;
  --spacing-md: 1rem;
  --font-primary: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}
```

**Step 2:** Import once in global component

```tsx
// themes/hapas/src/pages/all/GlobalStyles.tsx
import '../../styles/theme.css';

export default function GlobalStyles() {
  return null;
}

export const layout = {
  areaId: 'head',
  sortOrder: 1
};
```

**Step 3:** Use in components

```scss
// Component.scss
.component {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  padding: var(--spacing-md);
  font-family: var(--font-primary);
}
```

### ✅ Pattern 2: Tailwind CSS

```tsx
export default function Button() {
  return (
    <button className="bg-black text-white px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-800">
      Click Me
    </button>
  );
}
```

### ✅ Pattern 3: Self-Contained SCSS

```scss
// Define variables at top of each file
$local-primary: #000000;
$local-spacing: 1rem;

.component {
  color: $local-primary;
  padding: $local-spacing;
}
```

