## Common Area IDs

### Header Areas
```
'header'              // Full header
'headerTop'           // Announcement bar
'headerMiddle'        // Logo, search, cart
  'headerMiddleLeft'  // Logo
  'headerMiddleCenter'  // Search
  'headerMiddleRight'  // Cart/account
'headerBottom'        // Main navigation
```

### Content Areas
```
'content'             // Main content
'mainContent'         // Primary column
'sidebar'             // Filters, widgets
```

### Footer Areas
```
'footer'              // Full footer
'footerTop'           // Newsletter
'footerMiddle'        // Link columns
'footerBottom'        // Copyright
```

